<%# Capital distribution journey: the shared journey card (workflow_instances/_journey_panel) with the
    distribution's frame id and readiness warnings. Kept as this file because
    WorkflowInstancesController#render_journey_frame and CapitalDistributionsController#journey render
    "capital_distributions/journey" by convention.
    Locals: record (the distribution), journey (WorkflowEvaluator results, or nil), instance (or nil).
    Worked examples H3, H4, E6 — openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-02-capital-distribution-journey/design.md#worked-examples
    UI journey J2.1–J2.6 — openspec/changes/archive/2026-10-02-capital-distribution-journey/design.md#what-users-see %>
<%= render "workflow_instances/journey_panel",
           record:, journey:, instance: local_assigns[:instance], frame_id: "capital_distribution_journey", noun: "distribution",
           # Readiness warnings, only worked out when the card shows (they hold until investors are emailed)
           warnings: -> { WorkflowChecks::CapitalDistributionWarnings.new(record).to_a },
           warning_tip: "Check these before investors are emailed and paid" %>
